the description surprisingly your

00:03:49.959 --> 00:03:55.680
neurons inate or communicate with the

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:58.439
various cells that make up your blood

00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:00.319
vessels if we zoom in we know that

00:03:58.439 --> 00:04:02.680
neurons can influence the activity of

00:04:00.319 --> 00:04:05.159
endothelial cells the cells responsible

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:07.239
for controlling the blood vessel size

00:04:05.159 --> 00:04:09.680
remember the bigger the blood vessel the

00:04:07.239 --> 00:04:12.280
lower the blood pressure generally

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:14.879
neurons can influence endothelial cells

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:18.079
to release more Vaso constriction or

00:04:14.879 --> 00:04:21.280
vessel constriction factors or vessel

00:04:18.079 --> 00:04:23.560
relaxing factors isometric exercise does

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:27.080
not seem to activate what's known as

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:29.320
sympathetic Drive sympathetic Drive is

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:31.600
the neurons encouraging the endothelial

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:34.840
cells to to release Vaso constriction

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:38.360
factors surprisingly isometric exercise

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:41.320
doesn't activate that pathway which

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:43.320
would typically be expected in fact

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.520
neurons themselves independent of

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:48.560
endothelial cells can release factors

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:50.720
like nitric oxide that directly bind and

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:53.520
cause relaxation of the blood vessels

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:56.080
called a parasympathetic Drive I do

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:59.160
think there's a lot to uncover yet but

